  "/goal sets a goal every following turn will see; /goal clear drops it.": "/goal 设置一个之后每轮都能看到的目标；/goal clear 清除它。",
  "/loop works, then re-checks again and again; 30s is the pause between passes.": "/loop 执行一次，然后反复复查；30s 是每轮之间的间隔。",
  "/plan works out the steps before changing anything.": "/plan 在改动任何东西之前先规划步骤。",
  "0 = auto. Only the LU Engine and Anthropic take a thinking budget; other backends do not support one.": "0 = 自动。仅 LU Engine 和 Anthropic 接受思考预算；其他后端不支持。",
  "0 = default (8192). Raise to 16384 / 32768 for long chats and RAG if you have the memory; KV-cache size grows linearly with it.": "0 = 默认（8192）。内存充足时，长对话和 RAG 可提高到 16384 / 32768；KV 缓存大小会随之线性增长。",
  "0 = fit the model: runs from a 32K context window up, and compacts earlier on smaller windows than on large ones, because the summary and the answer need room too. Below 32K older turns are only shortened. Set 30 to 95 for a fixed point that runs on every window. Works before a message and in the middle of long tool runs, and the chat says each time it happened. Costs one extra model call each time it fires. You can always run it yourself with": "0 = 适配模型：从 32K 上下文窗口起运行，且在较小窗口上比在大窗口上更早压缩，因为摘要和回答也需要空间。低于 32K 时只会缩短较早的轮次。设为 30 到 95 可得到适用于所有窗口的固定阈值。在消息发送前和长时间工具运行中途均有效，每次触发时聊天中都会提示。每次触发会多消耗一次模型调用。你也可以随时用",
  "0 = let Ollama decide (defaults to 2048). Set to e.g. 8192 or 16384 if RAG / long chats get clipped. Cloud providers ignore this.": "0 = 由 Ollama 决定（默认 2048）。如果 RAG / 长对话被截断，可设为 8192 或 16384。云端提供商忽略此项。",
  "0 = no limit of its own: an attached text file goes out whole when it fits the model's context, and as far as it fits otherwise. Set a number of tokens to send less. Either way the chat says when a file was cut.": "0 = 不单独限制：附加文本文件在适配模型上下文时完整发送，否则尽可能多地发送。设置 token 数可减少发送量。无论哪种方式，文件被截断时聊天中都会提示。",
  "0 = no limit. Applies to the model files LU downloads itself, all of them together. Ollama pulls and installs are not limited.": "0 = 不限制。适用于 LU 自行下载的所有模型文件（合计）。Ollama 的拉取和安装不受限制。",
  "0 = off. Set 80 to have older turns summarised once the context is 80% full, instead of being dropped without a word. Values under 30 or over 95 count as off. Costs one extra model call each time it fires. You can always run it yourself with": "0 = 关闭。设为 80 后，上下文占用达到 80% 时会对较早轮次生成摘要，而不是无声丢弃。低于 30 或高于 95 的值视为关闭。每次触发会额外调用一次模型。你随时可以用",
  "0 = use the defaults (10 calls, 5 steps). A sub-agent runs unattended, so these stay deliberately tight, raise them only for a task you know is long.": "0 = 使用默认值（10 次调用，5 步）。子智能体无人值守运行，因此这些值刻意保持较小，仅在你确知任务较长时才调高。",
  "0 means unlimited: the loop keeps checking until it reports done or you stop it.": "0 表示不限制：循环会持续检查，直到报告完成或你手动停止。",
