  "A ComfyUI this app did not start is using this folder. Close that ComfyUI first, then try Update ComfyUI again.": "一个并非由本应用启动的 ComfyUI 正在使用此文件夹。请先关闭该 ComfyUI，然后再次尝试更新 ComfyUI。",
