  "A LoRA is a .safetensors file in the LoRA folder. Put your own there, or search CivitAI below: what you pick lands in that folder.": "LoRA 就是 LoRA 文件夹里的一个 .safetensors 文件。可以自己放进去，或在下方搜索 CivitAI：你选中的会放进该文件夹。",
  "A LoRA is a .safetensors file in the LoRA folder. Put your own there, paste a link below, or search CivitAI: what you pick lands in that folder.": "LoRA 是 LoRA 文件夹中的 .safetensors 文件。可自行放入、在下方粘贴链接，或搜索 CivitAI：选中的内容会放入该文件夹。",
  "A Mac has one chip and one pool of memory that processor and graphics share, so there is no graphics card to pick. Models run on Metal.": "Mac 只有一颗芯片和一块由处理器与图形共享的内存，因此没有独立显卡可选。模型通过 Metal 运行。",
