  "A character in Edit works without a mask. Z Image cannot paint into a masked area. Clear the mask to use the character.": "在编辑中，角色无需蒙版即可使用。Z Image 无法在蒙版区域内绘制。请清除蒙版以使用该角色。",
  "A character of another model family stays in LU Cloud, and LU says why.": "其他模型系列的角色会留在 LU Cloud，LU 会说明原因。",
