  "A click adds up to three photos the character was trained on, at most 1024 pixels each.": "点击可添加最多三张该角色训练用的照片，每张最多 1024 像素。",
  "A clip of": "一段",
  "A coding run is in flight. Wait for it to finish or press Stop, then you can change the folder.": "编码任务正在运行。请等待其完成或按“停止”，然后即可更改文件夹。",
  "A community finetune of Qwen-Image 2.1 by Noctaluna, published as an unfiltered edition": "Noctaluna 对 Qwen-Image 2.1 的社区微调版，以无过滤版本发布",
  "A community finetune of Qwen-Image 2.1 by Noctaluna, published as an unfiltered edition.": "Noctaluna 对 Qwen-Image 2.1 的社区微调版，以无过滤版本发布。",
  "A community finetune of Qwen-Image 2.1 by Noctaluna, published as an unfiltered edition. The image model itself is changed: its notice says the Qwen-Image 2.1 transformer weights were modified. Generates from a prompt and edits a reference image from a prompt, no mask needed. The text encoder and the VAE are the official files, shared with the official bundle and not downloaded twice. Qwen Research License, non-commercial use: https://huggingface.co/Noctaluna/Noct-Q-Uncensored-Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE": "Noctaluna 对 Qwen-Image 2.1 的社区微调，以无过滤版本发布。图像模型本身已改动：其声明称 Qwen-Image 2.1 的 transformer 权重已被修改。根据提示词生成图像，并根据提示词编辑参考图，无需蒙版。文本编码器和 VAE 为官方文件，与官方包共用，不会重复下载。Qwen 研究许可，非商业使用：https://huggingface.co/Noctaluna/Noct-Q-Uncensored-Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE",
  "A complete Evidence record exactly as a REA tool returned it.": "与 REA 工具返回内容完全一致的完整 Evidence 记录。",
  "A farmer has 17 sheep. All but 9 run away. How many sheep does the farmer have left? Explain your reasoning step by step.": "一个农夫有 17 只羊。除了 9 只以外，其余的都跑了。农夫还剩多少只羊？请逐步说明你的推理过程。",
  "A file called": "LoRA 文件夹中已存在名为",
