  "Add-on for Qwen-Image 2.1": "Qwen-Image 2.1 的附加组件",
  "Add-on for Qwen-Image 2.1.": "Qwen-Image 2.1 的附加组件。",
  "Add-on for Qwen-Image 2.1. The same prompt enhancer with its refusals taken out by the community (Heretic), so your prompt and your edit instruction stay what you wrote. Turns a short prompt into a long, detailed one and looks at your pictures when you edit. It runs before the image model and makes room for it afterwards. Turn it on with Improve my prompt in the advanced settings. Qwen Research License, non-commercial use: https://huggingface.co/Adahm/PE-Heretic-INT8-ConvRot-for-Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE": "Qwen-Image 2.1 的附加组件。同样的提示词增强器，但拒绝行为已由社区移除（Heretic），因此你的提示词和编辑指令保持原样。将简短提示词扩展为长而详细的提示词，并在编辑时查看你的图片。它在图像模型之前运行，之后为其腾出空间。在高级设置中通过“改进我的提示词”开启。Qwen 研究许可，非商业使用：https://huggingface.co/Adahm/PE-Heretic-INT8-ConvRot-for-Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE",
  "Add-on for Qwen-Image 2.1. Turns a short prompt or edit instruction into the long, detailed prompt the model works best with, and looks at your pictures when you edit. It runs before the image model and makes room for it afterwards. Made to play it safe: it can soften or refuse an instruction. Turn it on with Improve my prompt in the advanced settings. Qwen Research License, non-commercial use: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1-PE-T2I/blob/main/LICENSE": "Qwen-Image 2.1 的附加组件。将简短提示词或编辑指令扩展为模型最擅长的长而详细的提示词，并在编辑时查看你的图片。它在图像模型之前运行，之后为其腾出空间。以稳妥为先：它可能弱化或拒绝某条指令。在高级设置中通过“改进我的提示词”开启。Qwen 研究许可，非商业使用：https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1-PE-T2I/blob/main/LICENSE",
