  "Cloud credits (this billing period)": "云端额度（本计费周期）",
  "Cloud dictation needs a signed-in account with credits. Sign in under Settings → Account.": "云端听写需要已登录且有额度的账户。请在 设置 → 账户 中登录。",
  "Cloud features are hidden. Turn them back on in Settings, General.": "云端功能已隐藏。可在“设置 > 通用”中重新开启。",
  "Cloud mode is active.": "云端模式已启用。",
  "Cloud mode is on. Chat, image and video run on LU's hosted GPUs. Click to go back to Local.": "云端模式已开启。聊天、图像和视频都在 LU 的托管 GPU 上运行。点击可切回本地。",
  "Cloud mode shows hosted models only. Switch the app to Local mode to use Ollama, LM Studio or the LU Engine.": "云端模式仅显示托管模型。将应用切换到本地模式即可使用 Ollama、LM Studio 或 LU Engine。",
  "Cloud mode: dictation and read-aloud run on lu-labs.ai (hosted Whisper speech-to-text + MiniMax text-to-speech) and are metered against your credits. No local installs needed.": "云端模式：听写和朗读在 lu-labs.ai 上运行（托管的 Whisper 语音转文字 + MiniMax 文字转语音），并按你的额度计费。无需本地安装。",
  "Cloud mode: this message runs on LU's hosted GPUs and is billed to your lu-labs.ai credits. The Cloud switch up in the header turns it off.": "云端模式：这条消息在 LU 托管的 GPU 上运行，并计入你的 lu-labs.ai 额度。顶栏的 Cloud 开关可以关掉它。",
  "Cloud previews on Create tools and model lists, plus Try cloud tags on the tools that run both ways. Never blocks a local flow.": "在创建工具和模型列表中显示云端预览，并在支持两种运行方式的工具上显示“试用云端”标签。绝不会阻塞本地流程。",
  "Cloud providers send your data to external servers. Your conversations will no longer be fully private or offline.": "云提供商会将你的数据发送到外部服务器。你的对话将不再完全私密或离线。",
