  "H Company Holo 3.1 9B · for computer control. Looks at screenshots and picks the next click. Choose it in Settings under Computer control. Beta: in our test on Windows it finished a simple typing task in 1 of 3 runs. Recommended from 16 GB VRAM, or next to a small chat model: on 12 GB it does not fit next to a 9B chat model, LU swaps the two for every task and each swap takes about 20 seconds. The 0.6 GB vision projector comes with it. Apache-2.0.": "H Company Holo 3.1 9B · 用于电脑操控。它会查看屏幕截图并选择下一步点击位置。在“设置”的“电脑操控”中选择它。Beta：在我们的 Windows 测试中，3 次运行有 1 次完成了简单的打字任务。建议 16 GB VRAM 起用，或与小型聊天模型搭配：在 12 GB 上它无法与 9B 聊天模型同时容纳，LU 会为每个任务在两者间切换，每次切换约需 20 秒。附带 0.6 GB 视觉投影器。Apache-2.0。",
