  "LU is not allowed to read that folder. The path is there; the account this app runs as has no access to it. Pick a folder your own account owns, or grant this app access to that one.": "LU 无权读取该文件夹。路径存在，但本应用运行所用的账号没有访问权限。请选择你自己账号拥有的文件夹，或授予本应用访问该文件夹的权限。",
  "LU is switched on in the list, and this still says it is missing? Click Reset and ask again. macOS ties a permission to one exact build of LU, so after an update the old entry no longer counts. If LU is not in the list afterwards, add it with the plus button.": "列表中已开启 LU，这里却仍显示缺失？点击“重置”后重试。macOS 将权限绑定到 LU 的某个确切版本，因此更新后旧条目不再生效。如果之后列表中找不到 LU，请用加号按钮添加。",
  "LU loads LoRAs as .safetensors files only, and this link names another kind of file.": "LU 仅以 .safetensors 文件加载 LoRA，而此链接指向其他类型的文件。",
  "LU may look at your screen and use the mouse and the keyboard, in this chat only. It still asks before it touches an app. Stop at any time with": "LU 可以查看你的屏幕并使用鼠标和键盘，仅限此对话。操作应用前仍会先征求同意。随时按",
