  "MiniCPM-V 4.6 · pocket vision model (1.3B) that reads images and video in ~2 GB. Ollama pulls the vision projector automatically. Apache-2.0.": "MiniCPM-V 4.6 · 口袋级视觉模型（1.3B），约 2 GB 即可读取图像和视频。Ollama 会自动拉取视觉投影器。Apache-2.0。",
  "Minimal C++ inference. Low-level, maximum control.": "极简 C++ 推理。底层控制，最大自由度。",
  "Minutes a ComfyUI generation may go without any progress before LU stops it. Raise these if you run on iGPU or CPU only, because a single step of a 1024px image on integrated graphics can take many minutes.": "ComfyUI 生成在无任何进展的情况下可持续的最长分钟数，超过后 LU 会将其停止。如果你使用 iGPU 或仅用 CPU 运行，请调高此值，因为集成显卡上生成一张 1024px 图像的单个步骤可能就要好几分钟。",
