  "On a Mac, Native HiRes is there with Qwen-Image 2.1, the image model that also edits.": "在 Mac 上，原生高清配合 Qwen-Image 2.1 使用，这是同时支持编辑的图像模型。",
  "On a Mac, Qwen-Image 2.1 edits under a mask, or the whole image without one.": "在 Mac 上，Qwen-Image 2.1 可在蒙版下编辑，无蒙版时编辑整张图片。",
  "On a Mac, computer control is not fully tested yet. It may miss a click or fail to start. Watch it closely, and stop it when it goes wrong.": "在 Mac 上，计算机控制尚未经过完整测试。它可能漏掉点击或无法启动。请密切留意，出错时及时停止。",
  "On disk, but the host did not state its size and the catalog lists no checksum. Check again when you are online.": "已在磁盘上，但主机未提供其大小，目录中也未列出校验和。联网后请重新检查。",
  "On for this session: LU asks only before sensitive actions.": "本次会话已开启：LU 仅在敏感操作前询问。",
  "On its own LU uses the network for two things. It asks GitHub Releases for a new version a few seconds after start and at most every six hours after that; a new version is downloaded in the background unless you switch that off under Updates, and installing always needs your click. And it counts each press of the Cloud switch with LU Labs: which way it was pressed, platform and app version, no identifier.": "LU 自身仅因两件事使用网络。启动几秒后它会向 GitHub Releases 查询新版本，之后最多每六小时查询一次；除非你在“更新”中关闭，新版本会在后台下载，安装始终需要你点击。另外，它会向 LU Labs 统计每次按下云端开关的次数：按下方向、平台和应用版本，不含任何标识符。",
  "On its own LU uses the network for two things. It asks GitHub Releases for a new version a few seconds after start and at most every six hours after that; a new version is downloaded in the background unless you switch that off under Updates, and installing always needs your click. And it counts each press of the Cloud switch with LU Labs: which way it was pressed, platform and app version, no identifier. A click in the window behind the switch counts the same way: that a model, a plan or a pack was clicked, not which model.": "LU 自身会因两件事使用网络。启动几秒后会向 GitHub Releases 查询新版本，之后最多每六小时一次；除非你在“更新”中关闭，否则新版本会在后台下载，安装始终需要你点击。另外，每次按下 Cloud 开关都会向 LU Labs 计数：按下方向、平台和应用版本，不含任何标识符。开关后方窗口中的点击也以同样方式计数：即点击了某个模型、方案或包，而非具体是哪个模型。",
  "On the cloud character shelf, Use locally saves a Z-Image character into this computer's LoRA folder.": "在云端角色架上，“保存到本地”会把 Z-Image 角色存进本机的 LoRA 文件夹。",
  "On this computer": "在此电脑上",
  "On your": "在你的",
  "Once the chat is longer than": "对话超过",
  "Once the file is there, LU stops and says so instead of replacing it.": "文件已存在时，LU 会停下并提示，而不会覆盖它。",
  "One Create runs them all, one after the other.": "一次创建会依次处理全部图片。",
  "One OpenAI-compatible address for every model on this machine: LU Engine, Ollama and LM Studio under a single URL. Anything that can talk to OpenAI can talk to your local models through it.": "一个兼容 OpenAI 的地址，覆盖本机上的所有模型：LU Engine、Ollama 和 LM Studio 统一在一个 URL 下。任何能与 OpenAI 通信的工具都能通过它访问你的本地模型。",
  "One action per answer. After each action you get a new screenshot. When the goal is reached, say so and stop.": "每个回答只做一个操作。每次操作后你会得到一张新截图。达到目标后，说明并停止。",
  "One answer could not be spoken. The session goes on.": "有一条回答无法朗读。会话继续。",
  "One file": "单文件",
  "One file.": "单个文件。",
  "One free request at a time per account.": "每个账户同时只能有一个免费请求。",
  "One more file is needed": "还需要一个文件",
  "One more model turns this into a group.": "再加一个模型即可组成群聊。",
  "One per line, for example deepseek-chat": "每行一个，例如 deepseek-chat",
  "One person or character, varied angles and lighting works best": "一个人物或角色，多角度和不同光线效果最佳",
  "One shot. Add more to cut between shots in one clip.": "单个镜头。添加更多镜头可在同一片段中切换。",
  "One small model to get you running. You can browse and install more from the Models tab once you're in.": "先用一个小模型跑起来。进入后可在“模型”标签页浏览并安装更多模型。",
  "One-shot probe of the local backends and host facts. Use this when the app behaves oddly. Most \"model not found\" /": "一次性探测本地后端和主机信息。应用行为异常时使用。大多数“找不到模型”/",
  "Only 4 sampling steps needed": "仅需 4 步采样",
