  "Only https links are taken. Copy the link from the address bar of your browser.": "仅接受 https 链接。请从浏览器地址栏复制链接。",
  "Only inspection commands run here:": "此处仅运行检查类命令：",
  "Only plain letters, digits, spaces and punctuation work here, so the default is sent instead.": "此处仅支持普通字母、数字、空格和标点，因此改为发送默认值。",
  "Only programs on this machine reach the API. Other devices on the network do not.": "只有本机上的程序能访问 API，网络中的其他设备不能。",
  "Only the legal limits below apply.": "仅适用下方的法律限制。",
  "Only the legal limits below apply. Requires an age confirmation.": "仅适用下方的法律限制。需要确认年龄。",
  "Only the text encoder differs: the image model and the VAE are the official files, shared with the official bundle and not downloaded twice": "仅文本编码器不同：图像模型和 VAE 为官方文件，与官方包共用，不会重复下载",
  "Only the text encoder differs: the image model and the VAE are the official files, shared with the official bundle and not downloaded twice.": "仅文本编码器不同：图像模型和 VAE 为官方文件，与官方包共用，不会重复下载。",
  "Only then do the old files go to the Recycle Bin. Nothing is deleted for good.": "之后旧文件才会进入回收站。不会永久删除任何内容。",
  "Open Lyrics to write your own words.": "打开歌词，自己写词。",
  "Open Settings, Privacy & security, Microphone, and let desktop apps use the microphone. Then start again.": "打开“设置”>“隐私和安全性”>“麦克风”，允许桌面应用使用麦克风，然后重新开始。",
  "Open System Settings for": "打开系统设置以",
  "Open System Settings, Privacy & Security, Microphone, and switch it on for LU. Then start again.": "打开“系统设置”>“隐私与安全性”>“麦克风”，为 LU 开启权限，然后重新开始。",
  "Open a chat first": "请先打开一个聊天",
  "Open a chat first, the group lives on the conversation.": "请先打开一个对话，群聊依附于对话。",
  "Open a coding chat first, the mode lives on the conversation.": "请先打开一个编程对话，该模式依附于对话。",
  "Open a pull request for the current work. 1) \"git status\" and \"git log\" against the base branch so you know exactly what is going out. 2) If the work is still on the default branch, create a descriptive branch first. 3) Make sure everything intended is committed — if there are uncommitted changes, say what they are and ask before including them. 4) Push the branch. 5) Open the PR with a title that says what changed and a body covering what, why, and how it was verified.": "为当前工作发起拉取请求。1) 针对基础分支运行 \"git status\" 和 \"git log\"，明确将要提交的内容。2) 若工作仍在默认分支上，先创建描述性分支。3) 确保所有预期内容均已提交——若有未提交的更改，说明是什么并在纳入前询问。4) 推送分支。5) 发起 PR，标题说明更改内容，正文涵盖改了什么、为什么改以及如何验证。",
