  "Or use a gallery clip…": "或使用图库片段…",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · IQ4_XS, the cheapest 4 bit. Close to Q4_K_M on 16 GB cards.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · IQ4_XS，最便宜的 4 bit。在 16 GB 显卡上接近 Q4_K_M。",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · Q5, higher quality. For 24 GB cards.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · Q5，质量更高。适用于 24 GB 显卡。",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · Q6, near-lossless. High-VRAM setups.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · Q6，近乎无损。适合高显存配置。",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · Q8, full quality. 32 GB+ or CPU with lots of RAM.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · Q8，完整质量。需 32 GB+ 显存，或大内存 CPU。",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · one-command pull, projector included. Vision + tools + thinking out of the box. Needs Ollama 0.17.1 or newer.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · 一条命令拉取，含投影器。开箱即用视觉 + 工具 + 思考。需要 Ollama 0.17.1 或更新版本。",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · smallest quant, fits a 12 GB card. Real quality tradeoff, but it runs.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · 最小量化，可装入 12 GB 显卡。质量确有折损，但能跑起来。",
  "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · the viral abliterated build, from the author's own repo. Vision + thinking + tools, 262K context. Recommended quant. The 0.9 GB vision projector comes with it.": "OrcaRouter Qwen 3.8 27B uncensored · 爆火的 abliterated 版本，来自作者本人的仓库。视觉 + 思考 + 工具，262K 上下文。推荐量化。附带 0.9 GB 视觉投影器。",
  "Order it as {\"preset\":\"": "按此格式下单：{\"preset\":\"",
  "Ordered by average tokens per second multiplied by how often the answer was right, so a fast model that answers wrong does not outrank a slower one that answers correctly.": "次运行。按平均每秒 token 数乘以回答正确的频率排序，因此回答错误的快模型不会排在回答正确的慢模型之前。",
  "Ornith 1.5 35B MoE · higher quality quant.": "Ornith 1.5 35B MoE · 更高质量量化版。",
  "Ornith 1.5 35B MoE · largest quant, closest to the original weights.": "Ornith 1.5 35B MoE · 最大量化版，最接近原始权重。",
  "Ornith 1.5 35B MoE · the larger Ornith 1.5, 3B active parameters. Vision and tool calling. Recommended quant. The 0.9 GB vision projector comes with it. MIT.": "Ornith 1.5 35B MoE · 更大的 Ornith 1.5，3B 激活参数。视觉与工具调用。推荐量化版。附带 0.9 GB 视觉投影器。MIT。",
  "Ornith 1.5 9B uncensored": "Ornith 1.5 9B 无审查",
  "Ornith 1.5 9B uncensored · largest quant, closest to the original weights.": "Ornith 1.5 9B 无审查版 · 最大量化，最接近原始权重。",
  "Ornith 1.5 9B uncensored · smallest quant, for 8 GB machines.": "Ornith 1.5 9B 无审查版 · 最小量化，适合 8 GB 机器。",
  "Ornith 1.5 9B uncensored · the coding and agent model without refusals, with vision and tool calling. Recommended quant. The 0.9 GB vision projector comes with it.": "Ornith 1.5 9B 无审查版 · 不会拒绝的编程与智能体模型，带视觉和工具调用。推荐量化。附带 0.9 GB 视觉投影器。",
  "Ornith 1.5 9B · higher quality quant.": "Ornith 1.5 9B · 更高质量量化版。",
