  "Qwen-Image 2.1 reads LoRAs with lora_A and lora_B keys, the diffusers and ComfyUI format. This file is in the Kohya format, which Z-Image, FLUX.2 and Qwen-Image read.": "Qwen-Image 2.1 读取使用 lora_A 和 lora_B 键的 LoRA，即 diffusers 和 ComfyUI 格式。此文件为 Kohya 格式，适用于 Z-Image、FLUX.2 和 Qwen-Image。",
  "Qwen-Image 2.1 reads plain LoRAs with lora_A and lora_B keys only.": "Qwen-Image 2.1 仅读取使用 lora_A 和 lora_B 键的普通 LoRA。",
  "Qwen-Image 2.1 with a text encoder that has its refusal direction removed by the community (Heretic)": "Qwen-Image 2.1，其文本编码器已由社区移除拒绝方向（Heretic）",
  "Qwen-Image 2.1 with a text encoder that has its refusal direction removed by the community (Heretic).": "Qwen-Image 2.1，其文本编码器的拒绝方向已由社区移除（Heretic）。",
  "Qwen-Image 2.1 with a text encoder that has its refusal direction removed by the community (Heretic). Only the text encoder differs: the image model and the VAE are the official files, shared with the official bundle and not downloaded twice. Generates from a prompt and edits a reference image from a prompt, no mask needed. With both text encoders installed, pick one under Text encoder in the Expert settings. Image model under the Qwen Research License, non-commercial use: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE. Text encoder under Apache 2.0": "Qwen-Image 2.1，其文本编码器已由社区移除拒绝方向（Heretic）。仅文本编码器不同：图像模型和 VAE 为官方文件，与官方包共用，不会重复下载。根据提示词生成图像，并根据提示词编辑参考图像，无需蒙版。两个文本编码器都安装后，可在专家设置的文本编码器中选择一个。图像模型遵循 Qwen Research License，仅限非商业使用：https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE。文本编码器遵循 Apache 2.0",
  "Qwen-Image 2.1 with a text encoder that has its refusal direction removed by the community (Heretic). Only the text encoder differs: the image model and the VAE are the official files, shared with the official bundle and not downloaded twice. Generates from a prompt and edits a reference image from a prompt, no mask needed. With both text encoders installed, pick one under Text encoder in the Expert settings. Image model under the Qwen Research License, non-commercial use: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE. Text encoder under Apache 2.0.": "Qwen-Image 2.1，搭配由社区移除拒绝方向的文本编码器（Heretic）。仅文本编码器不同：图像模型和 VAE 为官方文件，与官方包共用，不会重复下载。根据提示词生成图像，并根据提示词编辑参考图，无需蒙版。两个文本编码器都安装后，可在专家设置的文本编码器中选择其一。图像模型遵循 Qwen 研究许可，非商业使用：https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE。文本编码器遵循 Apache 2.0。",
