  "TheDrummer Artemis 31B · largest quant, closest to the original weights.": "TheDrummer Artemis 31B · 最大量化，最接近原始权重。",
  "TheDrummer Artemis 31B · roleplay and creative-writing finetune on a Gemma 4 base, with vision. Recommended quant. The 1.2 GB vision projector comes with it.": "TheDrummer Artemis 31B · 基于 Gemma 4 的角色扮演与创意写作微调，带视觉。推荐量化。附带 1.2 GB 视觉投影器。",
  "TheDrummer Artemis 31B · smallest quant, for 16 GB machines.": "TheDrummer Artemis 31B · 最小量化，适合 16 GB 机器。",
  "TheDrummer Orion 26B MoE · largest quant, closest to the original weights.": "TheDrummer Orion 26B MoE · 最大量化，最接近原始权重。",
  "TheDrummer Orion 26B MoE · roleplay finetune on the Gemma 4 MoE base, 4B active parameters, with vision. Recommended quant. The 1.2 GB vision projector comes with it.": "TheDrummer Orion 26B MoE · 基于 Gemma 4 MoE 的角色扮演微调，4B 激活参数，带视觉。推荐量化。附带 1.2 GB 视觉投影器。",
  "TheDrummer Orion 26B MoE · smallest quant, for 16 GB machines.": "TheDrummer Orion 26B MoE · 最小量化，适合 16 GB 机器。",
  "TheDrummer Rocinante XL · roleplay / creative-writing specialist, successor to the classic Rocinante.": "TheDrummer Rocinante XL · 角色扮演 / 创意写作专用，经典 Rocinante 的继任者。",
  "Their lips move clearly with every word, natural expression, slight head movement, static camera.": "每个字的口型都清晰可见，表情自然，头部轻微移动，镜头固定。",
  "Then Music in Create is a local tab. The prompt sets the style, Lyrics takes your words.": "在 Create 中，Music 是一个本地标签页。提示词设定风格，Lyrics 接收你的歌词。",
  "Then the Enhance tab in Create runs on the Mac.": "然后创建中的增强标签页会在 Mac 上运行。",
  "Then the driving video: the movement the character copies.": "然后是驱动视频：角色要模仿的动作。",
  "Then train with the rest in Character Studio, or save them as a character.": "然后在角色工作室里用剩下的帧训练，或把它们保存为角色。",
  "Then type your first message. Your chats stay on your machine.": "然后输入你的第一条消息。聊天记录只保存在你的电脑上。",
