  "There were not enough credits to go on.": "额度不足，无法继续。",
  "These are project conventions defined by the user. Follow them": "这些是用户定义的项目约定。请遵循它们，",
  "These models download from Hugging Face. Anonymous downloads can be slower or rate limited; a free Hugging Face token avoids that. It goes under Hugging Face token, one section up.": "这些模型从 Hugging Face 下载。匿名下载可能较慢或受限；免费的 Hugging Face token 可避免此问题。请在上一节的 Hugging Face token 中填写。",
  "These turns are already short — a summary would take up more room than they do, so nothing changed.": "这些轮次本身已经很短——总结会比它们占用更多空间，因此未做任何更改。",
  "They appear in the model list next to the ones the server names. Up to": "它们会与服务器命名的模型一起出现在模型列表中。最多",
