  "This ComfyUI is missing its core inpaint nodes (VAEEncodeForInpaint). Update ComfyUI to a current version.": "此 ComfyUI 缺少核心局部重绘节点（VAEEncodeForInpaint）。请将 ComfyUI 更新到最新版本。",
