  "This model can't read images. Switch to a vision-capable model (e.g. Gemma 4, LLaVA, Qwen-VL, or Llama 3.2 Vision), or remove the attached image and send again.": "此模型无法读取图片。请切换到支持视觉的模型（如 Gemma 4、LLaVA、Qwen-VL 或 Llama 3.2 Vision），或移除所附图片后重新发送。",
