  "This model needs a newer ComfyUI than the one on": "此模型需要比以下位置更新的 ComfyUI：",
  "This model needs a painted mask for each image, so it edits one image at a time. Only the image above runs.": "此模型需要为每张图片绘制蒙版，因此每次只能编辑一张图片。仅运行上方图片。",
  "This model on CivitAI has no version to download.": "此 CivitAI 模型没有可下载的版本。",
