  "This model tried to call a tool, but Agent Mode is off for this chat, so nothing ran and it will keep emitting JSON that nothing reads.": "此模型尝试调用工具，但本对话的 Agent 模式已关闭，所以什么都没执行，它还会继续输出无人读取的 JSON。",
  "This model was loaded without its image part, so it cannot read the attachment. The model menu says why.": "此模型加载时未包含图像部分，因此无法读取附件。模型菜单中有说明。",
  "This model writes its own lyrics from the prompt.": "该模型会根据提示词自行创作歌词。",
