  "This month's video budget is used up": "本月视频额度已用完",
  "This month's video budget is used up. Top-up credits keep video going, or upgrade your plan.": "本月视频额度已用完。充值积分可继续生成视频，或升级套餐。",
  "This one runs in LU Cloud on a Mac — local generation covers images and video.": "此项在 Mac 上通过 LU Cloud 运行——本地生成支持图片和视频。",
  "This order": "此订单",
  "This order has not been approved. Nothing was started and nothing was charged.": "此订单尚未批准。没有启动任何任务，也没有扣费。",
  "This order:": "本订单：",
  "This path is not a folder LU can read.": "此路径不是 LU 可读取的文件夹。",
  "This persona is not a character card.": "此角色不是角色卡。",
  "This pulls the latest ComfyUI and reinstalls its Python packages. It can take a few minutes. If ComfyUI is running and this app started it, it will be stopped first; a ComfyUI this app did not start blocks the update instead. ComfyUI starts again when the update is done.": "此操作会拉取最新版 ComfyUI 并重新安装其 Python 包，可能需要几分钟。如果 ComfyUI 正在运行且由本应用启动，会先将其停止；若 ComfyUI 不是由本应用启动，则会阻止更新。更新完成后 ComfyUI 会重新启动。",
  "This render is no longer on disk.": "此渲染图已不在磁盘上。",
  "This render is no longer on disk. Pick another one, or upload the file from disk.": "此渲染已不在磁盘上。请选择其他渲染，或从磁盘上传文件。",
  "This render is not on disk any more, so there is nothing to save.": "此渲染已不在磁盘上，没有可保存的内容。",
  "This render is on this Mac, but its file could not be read just now.": "此渲染在本机上，但暂时无法读取其文件。",
  "This render lives on the local engine, which isn't reachable right now. It shows up again as soon as ComfyUI is running.": "此渲染位于本地引擎，当前无法连接。ComfyUI 运行后会重新显示。",
  "This request requires credits. No generation started.": "此请求需要额度。未开始生成。",
  "This request uses credits instead of the free Flash allowance.": "此请求使用额度，而非免费 Flash 额度。",
  "This result is no longer stored. Results are kept for 7 days.": "此结果已不再保存。结果保留 7 天。",
  "This runs a second, hidden model call every 3rd turn on your own machine. It costs no money, only time and memory.": "每第 3 轮会在你自己的机器上额外运行一次隐藏的模型调用。不花钱，只消耗时间和内存。",
  "This runs a second, hidden model call every 3rd turn, billed like a chat turn. It uses the cheapest model in the catalogue, not the one you chat with.": "每第 3 轮会额外运行一次隐藏的模型调用，按一次聊天轮次计费。它使用目录中最便宜的模型，而不是你正在聊天的模型。",
  "This runs a second, hidden model call every 3rd turn, which adds to your API costs.": "每第 3 轮会额外运行一次隐藏的模型调用，这会增加你的 API 费用。",
  "This runs in the background and survives leaving this tab.": "此任务在后台运行，离开此标签页也不会中断。",
  "This runs in the background and survives leaving this tab. The Model Manager shows the same progress, under Image.": "此任务在后台运行，离开此标签页也不会中断。模型管理器会在图像分类下显示相同进度。",
  "This runs in the background and survives leaving this tab. The Model Manager shows the same progress, under Video.": "此任务在后台运行，离开此标签页也不会中断。模型管理器会在视频分类下显示相同进度。",
  "This server did not report the model's context length, so LU cannot check these sizes. Pick the size the server runs with. Reloads the model on change.": "此服务器未报告模型的上下文长度，因此 LU 无法检查这些大小。请选择服务器实际运行的大小。更改后会重新加载模型。",
  "This sets up Apple MLX on this Mac and downloads the smallest image model to start with,": "此操作将在此 Mac 上设置 Apple MLX，并下载最小的图像模型作为起点，",
  "This sets up Apple MLX video on this Mac and downloads": "这将在本 Mac 上配置 Apple MLX 视频并下载",
  "This sets up Apple MLX video on this Mac and downloads a video model to start with. Video renders take minutes per clip, not seconds. More models are in Models, under Video.": "此操作将在此 Mac 上设置 Apple MLX 视频，并下载一个视频模型作为起点。视频渲染每段需要数分钟，而非数秒。更多模型位于“模型”下的“视频”中。",
  "This sets up everything for a fully local run: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the Juggernaut XL starter checkpoint (~6.5 GB). That same model also powers the local Edit tab.": "此操作为完全本地运行准备好一切：如缺少 ComfyUI 则安装它，以及 Juggernaut XL 起始检查点（约 6.5 GB）。同一模型也用于本地编辑标签页。",
  "This sets up everything for a fully local run: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the starter model files.": "此操作为完全本地运行准备好一切：如缺少 ComfyUI 则安装它，以及起始模型文件。",
  "This sets up everything for fully local music: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the ACE Step 1.5 music model (~9.3 GB, runs from 6 GB VRAM). Local music is never filtered.": "此操作为完全本地音乐准备好一切：如缺少 ComfyUI 则安装它，以及 ACE Step 1.5 音乐模型（约 9.3 GB，6 GB VRAM 起可运行）。本地音乐永不过滤。",
  "This sets up everything for fully local upscaling: ComfyUI itself if it’s missing, plus the Real-ESRGAN x4plus upscale model (~67 MB, runs from 2 GB VRAM).": "这将为完全本地的放大功能准备好一切：缺少时安装 ComfyUI 本身，以及 Real-ESRGAN x4plus 放大模型（约 67 MB，2 GB VRAM 即可运行）。",
  "This sets up the Wan 2.2 S2V model plus its audio encoder (~20 GB total).": "此操作将设置 Wan 2.2 S2V 模型及其音频编码器（共约 20 GB）。",
  "This sets up the Wan VACE motion model plus its support files (~10.5 GB, runs from 8 GB VRAM). The bigger Wan Animate variant is in the Model Manager.": "此操作将设置 Wan VACE 动作模型及其支持文件（约 10.5 GB，8 GB VRAM 起可运行）。更大的 Wan Animate 变体位于模型管理器中。",
  "This sets up the trainer's Python environment again: PyTorch and musubi-tuner get reinstalled. Your training photos and downloaded base models are not touched. Setup needs about 3 GB of downloads, same as the first install.": "这会重新配置训练器的 Python 环境：PyTorch 和 musubi-tuner 将被重新安装。你的训练照片和已下载的基础模型不会受影响。安装需要约 3 GB 下载量，与首次安装相同。",
  "This size is already as large as the engine makes it.": "此尺寸已是引擎能生成的最大尺寸。",
  "This summary could not be read back.": "无法读回此摘要。",
  "This tab has no video model installed, so no video can start from your character. Install one with Download & install above, or remove the character.": "此标签页未安装视频模型，因此无法以你的角色生成视频。请使用上方的“下载并安装”安装一个，或移除该角色。",
  "This tab takes images. For a video, open the clip from your gallery.": "此标签页只接受图片。要处理视频，请从图库中打开片段。",
  "This tool did NOT run, so there is no output. Do not state or guess what it would have returned. Either call it again with corrected arguments, or tell the user plainly that this step failed.": "此工具未运行，因此没有输出。不要陈述或猜测它本应返回的内容。请用修正后的参数再次调用它，或直接告诉用户此步骤失败。",
  "This tool does not run locally on a Mac. Turn on Cloud to use it.": "此工具无法在 Mac 上本地运行。请开启云端以使用它。",
