  "When ComfyUI does not know a node of the workflow, LU names it. For a pack LU knows it offers the install right there. For any other, paste the pack's Git link under Settings, ComfyUI node packs. Restart ComfyUI afterwards and import again.": "当 ComfyUI 不认识工作流中的某个节点时，LU 会指出它。对于 LU 已知的包，会直接提供安装。对于其他包，请将包的 Git 链接粘贴到设置中的 ComfyUI 节点包。之后重启 ComfyUI 并重新导入。",
  "When the conversation fills this much of the window, the model writes a summary of the older turns and those turns stop being sent. 0 = off. The full history stays in the chat either way; only what is sent changes.": "当对话占用窗口达到此比例时，模型会为较早的轮次生成摘要，这些轮次不再发送。0 = 关闭。无论是否开启，完整历史都保留在聊天中，只有发送的内容会变化。",
  "When the conversation or a running tool chain fills this much of the window, the model writes a summary of the older part and that part stops being sent. 0 = fit the model's context window, from 32K up. The full history stays in the chat either way; only what is sent changes.": "当对话或正在运行的工具链占满窗口的这一比例时，模型会为较早的部分写一份摘要，该部分不再发送。0 = 适配模型的上下文窗口，从 32K 起。无论哪种方式，完整历史都保留在聊天中，只有发送的内容会变化。",
  "Where LU keeps the voice engine, the read-aloud voices and its own Python. Leave it empty and LU uses its app data folder. Choosing a folder moves nothing: new installs go there, and what is installed keeps working where it is until you move it.": "LU 存放语音引擎、朗读语音和自带 Python 的位置。留空则 LU 使用其应用数据文件夹。选择文件夹不会移动任何内容：新安装会放到那里，已安装的内容会继续在原位置工作，直到你手动移动。",
